Vendored from speech-dispatcher 0.12.0 (https://github.com/brailcom/speechd,
commit 4a802ebbf93c838012a66a8edf5fbd7a373efcbc, src/modules and src/common):

  module_main.c, module_readline.c, module_process.c, spd_module_main.h
      BSD-licensed helper library for writing speech-dispatcher output modules
      (Copyright Samuel Thibault and others; licence text in each file).
  spd_audio.h
      GNU LGPL 2.1 or later (Copyright Brailcom, o.p.s.; Samuel Thibault).

They are included because Debian-based distributions, Raspberry Pi OS among
them, do not ship spd_module_main.h or libspeechd_module. The files are
unmodified.
